<title>UK: Cabco Finance sets 450 bln lire FRN due Jan 2013.</title>
<headline>Cabco Finance sets 450 bln lire FRN due Jan 2013.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced  by joint lead managers Cariplo and Chase Manhattan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CABCO FINANCE B.V. 1997-3</p>
<p> AMT    450 BLN LIRE  BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    02.JAN.13</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE  S-03.SEP.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    PAR	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-50	AVG LIFE    9.6 YRS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	BACKED BY AMORTISING 450 BLN LIRE LOAN TO THE</p>
<p>		REGION OF TUSCANY.</p>
<p>		ISSUE OFF ITS MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
